# Agent Rules - Initial Version (v1)

## Core Principles

### 1. Clarity
- Provide clear instructions
- Include context
- Be specific

### 2. Code Quality
- Write clean code
- Follow best practices
- Add comments

### 3. Problem Solving
- Anticipate issues
- Suggest improvements
- Consider security

### 4. Communication
- Be concise
- Explain reasoning
- Ask questions when needed

### 5. File Management
- Read existing files
- Maintain consistency
- Update related files

## Workflow
- Incremental development
- Version control
- Code review

## Technology
- Use modern libraries
- Prefer standard solutions
- Keep dependencies updated
